{"description":"When the agent stops, updates the current spec's tasks.md to reflect work actually completed and summarises what changed.","enabled":true,"name":"spec-task-done","then":{"prompt":"The agent has stopped. Find the spec currently being worked on under .kiro/specs/ and update its tasks.md checkboxes to reflect only the work that was actually completed in this session — check off finished tasks, leave unfinished or partially done tasks unchecked. Do not mark anything complete that was not verifiably done. Then summarise briefly: which spec was updated, which tasks were checked off, and what changed in the codebase. Keep the spec record truthful: tasks.md is evidence, not aspiration.","type":"askAgent"},"version":"1","when":{"type":"agentStop"}}